{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601220","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601220","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1460122001:1":{"text":"辛巴达的进攻非常精准，而这是建立在他对战场及时的观察和分析上的。","source_cn":"辛巴达的进攻非常精准，而这是建立在他对战场及时的观察和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D997C1C03AB57F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460122002:1":{"text":"犹如直觉一般选择目标，并异常冷静地击中破绽，在被围攻时，这很适合打开局面。","source_cn":"犹如直觉一般选择目标，并异常冷静地击中破绽，在被围攻时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED4F044CFA491015","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460122003:1":{"text":"这是妈妈们教过我的接舷战技巧，在船上作战时威力会变得更强。","source_cn":"这是妈妈们教过我的接舷战技巧，在船上作战时威力会变得更强。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x526AE6E176A94E98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460122004:1":{"text":"血薇帮的二位攻防一体的联手作战浑然一体，简直毫无破绽。","source_cn":"血薇帮的二位攻防一体的联手作战浑然一体，简直毫无破绽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EECFF2A5257DE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1460122005:1":{"text":"这是血薇的誓约，我将守护战场的同伴。而卢卡的战吼也始终激励着我。","source_cn":"这是血薇的誓约，我将守护战场的同伴。而卢卡的战吼也始终...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FA2DF4EDE1D3040","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docum